WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
You get a match.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:05.250
But it has no time, place
or shared plan.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.800
MyScoutee builds
that missing path.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.850
Your interest becomes a private,
editable one-to-ten priority,

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.800
connected with mutual intent,
distance and context.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A balanced group can form
around one activity.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.800
Each person sees the proposal
and accepts or declines.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.700
Those who accept share
one contextual chat,

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.800
then coordinate people and travel,
place and supplies.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.900
Then you meet.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.850
Profiles gain voices.
Strangers gain real context.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.800
Every priority
stays private.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.150
The next invitation begins
with shared experience,

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:45.300
not another cold
opening line.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.700
MyScoutee is designed
for the meeting.
